  "description": {
   "en": "“Pain, pain, go away…”\nThe urban legend of the “Flesh Exorcism Village”. A village of suicidal people hidden at the end of a cave called “Fire Hole” in the Sea of Trees at Mt. Fuji. It's rumored that an evil cult of cannibals remains there and eats those who are lured there. Ryuu, a high school student, sets out for the village, relying on a letter from his missing brother. However, the village is roamed by the “Meat Scavengers”, ghosts who use blades to cut off pieces of the bodies of their captives…\n___\n**Alt Official Raw:** [MAGCOMI](https://magcomi.com/episode/13933686331709723159)"
